  "title": {
   "en": "Shiawase ni Naritai Masamune-kun"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "幸せになりたいマサムネ君"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Masamune lives a somewhat negative life in Tokyo, and due to the fact that he came into possession of a large sum of money by chance, and the trauma of his past, he lives his life in a slump, trying not to work as much as possible. I often fight with my girlfriend Momoka, but she's still a first year high school student. We've been together for 10 years since then. My relationship with Momoka isn't bad, it's not that bad...how many times have you told me that you love me?\n\nWhy is it that I am not satisfied? At that time, I was taken by my colleague Nakata-san and we met at a shared bar..."
  },
